# armour/shared/pauldron_feather3_l: the medium FEATHER pauldron on the left shoulder (feather.3;
# P5b production 2, area C: tools/doll/p5b_sig_C2.py, NEW). The large feather mantle (pauldron_feather4_l) at its T4
# fitted reach taken in to T3's: 2 px past the shoulder line facing D (20 px across with its pair, STYLE_P2 29.3), its new
